msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://www.redhat.com/en/engage/idc-the-quarkus-edge-analyst-"
"material\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong><em>Download the full "
"report</em></strong></a>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you’re part of the Quarkus community, you already know it’s fast, "
"lightweight, and designed for cloud-native workloads. But have you ever "
"wondered how other organizations are using Quarkus in production?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A new IDC whitepaper, *_The Quarkus Edge: How Real Customers Achieve Speed, "
"Performance, and Agility_*, showcases how three organizations have "
"transformed their developer productivity, infrastructure efficiency, and "
"business agility with Quarkus. These case studies highlight why "
"organizations are choosing Quarkus and how it's driving measurable results "
"in industries like telecommunications, transportation, and banking."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you're looking for compelling, real-world stories to share with your "
"peers, leadership, or decision-makers, this report is exactly what you need. "
"Let's dive into the highlights."
msgstr ""

msgid "Why Organizations Are Choosing Quarkus"
msgstr ""

msgid "The report highlights several common drivers behind Quarkus adoption:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"✅ *Massive Performance Gains*: up to *10x* CPU cost reduction and *85%* "
"faster start-up times."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"✅ *Cloud-Native & Kubernetes-Ready*: built for containerization and event-"
"driven architectures."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"✅ *Developer Productivity Boosts*: live coding, lower memory footprint, and "
"seamless integration w/ DevOps workflows."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"✅ *Lower Costs*: significant reduction in cloud infrastructure spend, "
"especially for high-throughput, low-latency applications. +"
msgstr ""

msgid "Case Study #1 (Telco): Powering Edge &amp; IoT with Quarkus"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A major telecommunications company needed to meet 5G and edge computing "
"demands. After benchmarking against alternatives like Spring WebFlux and "
"Vert.x, they selected Quarkus for its CPU efficiency and latency performance."
""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"🔹 *10x* reduction in CPU costs, crucial for high-throughput workloads."
msgstr ""

msgid "🔹 Lower latency, enabling real-time IoT and edge applications."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"🔹 Seamless integration with Kafka, RabbitMQ, and event-driven architectures."
""
msgstr ""

msgid "Case Study #2 (Transportation): Faster Event-Driven Services"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A global transportation services provider turned to Quarkus for its event-"
"driven architecture (EDA). The result was a dramatic reduction in "
"infrastructure footprint and start-up times, helping them move toward a "
"cloud-native future."
msgstr ""

msgid "🔹 Start-up time reduced from *5-10* minutes to seconds."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"🔹 Significantly lower memory and CPU usage, cutting operational costs."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"🔹 Seamless event-driven integration with Kafka and reactive messaging."
msgstr ""

msgid "Case Study #3 (Banking): Modernizing Financial Services"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A leading European bank began migrating its core banking platform to "
"Quarkus, driven by support discontinuation for legacy systems. They needed a "
"solution that was secure, scalable, and cost-effective."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"🔹 *85%* faster start-up times, improving deployment and system resilience."
msgstr ""

msgid "🔹 *30%* more applications hosted on existing infrastructure."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"🔹 Increased developer productivity, reducing time-to-market for new "
"financial products."
msgstr ""

msgid "Use This Report to Advocate for Quarkus"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you’re already using or evaluating Quarkus, this report is a powerful "
"tool to help spread the word within your organization."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"🔹 *developers*: share it with your peers to highlight how Quarkus improves "
"developer experience and reduces friction in cloud-native development."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"🔹 *architects & decision-makers*: use the case studies to showcase Quarkus’ "
"proven success in real-world deployments."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"🔹 *executives*: the whitepaper quantifies cost savings, performance gains, "
"and business agility, making the case for standardizing on Quarkus."
msgstr ""

